<section class="section" id="why-us">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <div><div class="kicker" data-i18n="diff_kicker">Why HomePro</div><h2 data-i18n="diff_h1">Built for<br>South Florida.</h2></div>
    <p data-i18n="diff_desc">Florida City sits in the High-Velocity Hurricane Zone — we work with contractors who know its rules.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <article class="feat reveal"><span class="feat-num">01</span><h3 data-i18n="diff1_t">License-checked pros</h3><p data-i18n="diff1_p">Every contractor is license-checked. You see the license number and status before hiring — verify anytime at MyFloridaLicense.com.</p></article>
    <article class="feat reveal"><span class="feat-num">02</span><h3 data-i18n="diff2_t">HVHZ specialists</h3><p data-i18n="diff2_p">Pros familiar with High-Velocity Hurricane Zone rules, Miami-Dade NOA products and the Florida Building Code 9th Edition (2026).</p></article>
    <article class="feat reveal"><span class="feat-num">03</span><h3 data-i18n="diff3_t">24/7 storm response</h3><p data-i18n="diff3_p">After a storm, our network prioritizes emergencies: roofing, pumps, generators and sealing — day and night.</p></article>
    <article class="feat reveal"><span class="feat-num">04</span><h3 data-i18n="diff4_t">Financing options</h3><p data-i18n="diff4_p">Big projects like roofs, windows or HVAC? Split payments through local financing partners.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 16px }
  .feat { position: relative; padding: 26px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 24px; background: #080a0d; overflow: hidden }
  .feat-num { font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .18em; color: var(--red) }
  .feat h3 { font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-size: 21px; margin: 44px 0 10px; letter-spacing: -.01em }
  .feat p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.65 }
  .feat:after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 26px; right: 26px; bottom: 0; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,var(--red),transparent); opacity: 0; transition: .3s var(--ease) }
  .feat:hover:after { opacity: 1 }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr }
  }
</style>
